(text "IN100 insect tag v4: 6.4 mm round tag, printed antenna arm, cut-off programming tab" (at 25.4 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f039836c-9f1d-4463-ba4a-eada1ae82844))
(text "- CHIP_EN, VDDQ and VCC tied together. Supply 3.3 V on the tab pads while burning the OTP; never with the cell fitted." (at 25.4 170.434 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc7293a4-1b14-4417-90f1-63ab9720ab4d))
(text "- Y1 26 MHz 1612, 7 pF load: the IN100's on-chip load capacitance replaces external caps." (at 25.4 173.228 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc389285-a4c5-43fd-94ca-03440d87e67f))
(text "- C1 100 nF at the VCC/VDDQ pins; C2 10 uF bulk for TX bursts from the 337 cell." (at 25.4 176.022 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3bfafebe-d95c-434a-8163-0cb11f33260a))
(text "- AE1: 29.75 mm quarter-wave trace up the 0.8 mm FR-4 arm, fed straight from RF_TX (trim the arm to tune)." (at 25.4 178.816 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b171d137-2b63-4441-acef-962fbcb2ffcc))
(text "- BT1: 337 / SR416SW cell under the tag on Kapton; welded tabs onto the two rim pads (+ left, - lower right)." (at 25.4 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 969e3cb5-707e-49a5-ab47-a29e04eb5503))
(text "- J1: 2 x 2 plated pads on the tab (R + / T G); cut the neck after programming." (at 25.4 184.404 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5da7384e-b72a-4463-9dbe-16596d5cc1f0))
(text "Derived from the IN100 datasheet reference design and SparkFun's NanoBeacon board (CC BY-SA 4.0)." (at 25.4 187.198 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e049ddb-3cce-4c57-8f63-13132d70c1dd))
